  "title": "Introducing ktx: the Open-Source Context Layer That Makes Data Agents Reliable",
  "summary": "ktx is the open-source, executable context layer for data agents. It ingests your data stack and internal docs and turns them into an executable semantic layer plus a wiki, so agents query ktx for correct SQL instead of guessing from raw schema.",
